        "asked_at": "2026-10-18 08:30:00",
        "question_text": "3 号育肥舍这两天采食量下降，可能是什么原因？",
        "images": null,
        "batch_id": 3001,
        "batch_no": "ZM2610-031",
        "context_course_title": null,
        "status": "ANSWERED",
        "answer_type": "NORMAL",
        "answer_text": "常见原因有舍温偏高、饮水不足、饲料变质或适口性变化、疾病早期等。先看舍温和饮水器，再检查饲料。",
        "citations": [],
        "rating": null,
        "rated_at": null,
        "can_rate": true,
        "can_copy": true,
        "in_context": false,
        "correction": null,
        "error_code": null,
        "error_message": null,
        "answered_at": "2026-10-18 08:30:20"
      },
      {
        "id": 5481,
        "session_id": 1018,
        "round_no": 2,
        "asked_at": "2026-10-18 08:34:00",
        "question_text": "舍内温度 28 度算高吗？",
        "images": null,
        "batch_id": 3001,
        "batch_no": "ZM2610-031",
        "context_course_title": null,
        "status": "ANSWERED",
        "answer_type": "NORMAL",
        "answer_text": "育肥猪适宜温度一般在 16 至 22 度，28 度偏高，会明显降低采食。建议加强通风和喷雾降温。",
        "citations": [],
        "rating": null,
        "rated_at": null,
        "can_rate": true,
        "can_copy": true,
        "in_context": false,
        "correction": null,
        "error_code": null,
